; ============================================================================
; Level 4 — Frost Vale. Two-path converge, 10-wave first long-form campaign
; level (L4+ 10-minute rule). Encounter identity: balanced two-lane defense,
; anti-air checks during ground pressure, armor convoys, fast leak tests,
; brutes that demand blocking, and a boss-escort finale.
;
; Path ids match Level4.tscn: north / south.
; ============================================================================

